{"title": "Elizabeth M. Soot", "pageid": 53473, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elizabeth_M._Soot", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Elizabeth M. Soot</b> is an author who has written about evil beings and how to overcome them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Elizabeth M. Soot is an author of multiple works, each featuring evil beings, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag\" title=\"Hag\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hags\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hag\" title=\"Hag\">Hags</a>. Having served a hag for at least two years, she gives a first hand account on how to deal with them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Brush_with_Evil:_On_Hags\" title=\"A Brush with Evil: On Hags\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_Brush_with_Evil:_On_Hags\" title=\"A Brush with Evil: On Hags\">A Brush with Evil: On Hags</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Evil_Eye\" title=\"The Evil Eye\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Book_Tome_Q_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Evil_Eye\" title=\"The Evil Eye\">The Evil Eye</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elizabeth_Soot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5